          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "Companion-only drag. Cumulative CSS screen-coordinate deltas from pointerdown; start begins a gesture, move/end require an active gesture. SDK defaults: 350 ms hold, 8 px pre-hold tolerance, pointer capture; drag suppresses the following click."
        }
      },
