        "type"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Only the sending companion is affected. Anchor may change to any declared v0 anchor; size is clamped to the manifest size per axis, or 160 when omitted. Invalid requests are ignored. Anchor requests reset the persisted free position. Move positions are clamped to the viewport with 24 px margin and avoid the gear and dock. On a restored surface the first anchor request matching its saved anchor reaffirms that preset without clearing the free position, so plugin startup does not undo restoration. Later anchor requests always reset it."
